<title>USA: CellStar names new president and new CFO.</title>
<headline>CellStar names new president and new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLLTON, Texas 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CellStar Corp said Monday that it has named Chief Financial Officer Richard Gozia as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Both positions had been vacant since July, when former President and COO Terry Parker left for health reasons.</p>
<p>The company said Mark Huggins will succeed Gozia as chief financial officer in January. Huggins has been chief financial officer of Van Camp Seafood Co Inc since 1992, CellStar said.</p>
